; The generator's eggs, zone 8 area 50 (Ryan, 2026-11-04: instead of carrying them to safety, the first one smashes and the mother turns on you, a mini boss; at half her health the two eggs left hatch, and her two babies fight beside her).
; Flags: stock 117, 118, 119 an egg gone (its decoration hidden at the load, its tube breakable: the item's condition, tested at a load only, so her end warps to the same room, a white blink), our 476 the fight begun, 478 the eggs hatched, 477 she is down.
; Records: 0 the mother standing, 1 the fight to half her health, 2 the rest of it, 3-5 a baby at each egg (spawned by TriggerMapEvent only).
; She ends the fight: babies still standing go with her, by the warp; a room left and entered again brings her back without them, so nothing can be left unfinished. Lines are Claude's drafts; hers show her portrait, 173 (King Triceratops' recoloured, tools/ppportraits.py).

; an egg's A, as the map loads: while it is whole and the fight has not begun (the sequences check again: a trigger's condition is a load's)
script z8_egg_open1
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 117
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 476
        And
end

script z8_egg_open2
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 118
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 476
        And
end

script z8_egg_open3
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 119
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 476
        And
end

; her records, on a load during the fight (a player left the room and came back)
script z8_dino_first_half
        StackTestStoryFlag 476
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 478
        And
end

script z8_dino_second_half
        StackTestStoryFlag 478
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 477
        And
end

; one sequence an egg. Entry 0: once the fight has begun an egg does nothing (next index 7: the end)
sequence z8_egg1
  [0] script
        StackTestStoryFlag 476
        JumpIfFalse free
        PushByte 9
        END
      free:
        SetStoryFlag 117
        END
  [1] fmt 1 "@%s: Eggs, sitting right on the generator?\x0bEasy does it.  Just gonna move this one out of the way."
        PushActiveCharName
  [2] text 0 "@^The shell is slick, and heavier than it looks...\x0bCRACK!"
  [3] script
        PlayAudio 21
        FindEntityByType 7
        WhiteFlash 10
        WaitFrames 24
  [4] fmt 1 "@%s: ...\x0bThat was like that when I got here."
        PushActiveCharName
  [5] script                             ; the ground shakes: she comes round the generator
        PlayAudio 60
        ScreenShake 0, 10, 30
        WalkToPosition 245, 356, 340
        SetEntityFacing 245, 2
        SetEntityFacing 0, 3
        WaitFrames 12
  [6] text 173 "@MOTHER DINOSAUR: MY EGG!\x0bYou clumsy little monkey!"
  [7] text 173 "@MOTHER DINOSAUR: I'll stomp you flat for that!"
  [8] script -> 9
        SetStoryFlag 476
        WhiteFlash 20
        PlayAudio 60
        ScreenShake 0, 8, 20
        DespawnCharacterAndRecordPosition 245, 1
        DrawBossHealthBarRange 245, 50, 100
        SetActiveEntity 0
end

